{
  "$comment": "MARKETING COPY + THE OFFLINE FREE FLOOR. Autumn is the billing source of truth (SPEC §10): plans, entitlements, prices, credit packs and the trial are configured THERE, and `billing:sync` / `billing:publish` are gone. Two things still live here, for reasons that are not laziness. (1) DISPLAY: plans[].display, matrix and positioning drive /pricing and the in-app plan cards. Autumn stores no marketing text and never will. (2) THE OFFLINE FREE FLOOR: plans[].entitlements feeds FREE_ENTITLEMENTS in catalog.ts, which is what an org resolves to when there is no billing backend to ask — no AUTUMN_SECRET_KEY, an unknown customer, the CLI. It is deliberately the most conservative answer rather than a mirror of whatever Free currently grants. KNOWN DRIFT RISK, recorded rather than solved: prices[] still supplies the numbers on the PUBLIC /pricing page, because that page must render with no key and no network (the smoke gate boots it with neither). Autumn supplies the numbers everywhere money actually moves. Change a price in Autumn and you MUST change it here too, or the storefront and the checkout disagree — no test can catch it, because catching it needs a live Autumn call. Money is integer cents; credits are integers.",
